{"chunk_id": "WF-US-EO14117-RESTRICTED", "source_id": "WF-US-EO14117", "title": "EO 14117 先判断 restricted transaction", "content": "EO 14117 场景首先判断交易类型是否属于 restricted transaction、是否涉及 data brokerage / vendor agreement / employment agreement 例外。", "layer": "L2_business_rule", "template_type": "none", "source_kind": "workflow_rule", "module": "us_eo14117", "jurisdiction": "us", "doc_type": "workflow_rule", "authority_level": "low", "binding_force": "reference", "allowed_usage": ["internal_review", "risk_explanation"], "can_be_cited": false, "can_enter_external_report": false, "reference_ids": ["US-FED-001"], "citation_anchor": "EO 14117 先判断 restricted transaction", "scenario_tags": ["review", "issue_discovery", "restricted_transaction"], "chunk_strategy": "workflow_step", "article_no": "", "path": "eo14117", "source_url": "", "snapshot_path": "", "keywords": [], "structured_payload": {"rule_name": "us_eo14117_restricted_transaction", "output_action": "issue_discovery", "required_topics": ["transaction_type", "data_brokerage", "vendor_agreement_exception"]}}
{"chunk_id": "WF-US-EO14117-PROHIBITED", "source_id": "WF-US-EO14117", "title": "EO 14117 §100.2 禁止交易类别", "content": "EO 14117 §100.2 明确禁止以下交易: (1) 数据经纪交易涉及受关注国家/涵盖人员; (2) 向涵盖人员传输美国政府相关数据; (3) 大规模人类基因组数据向涵盖人员传输。判定禁止交易时需严格依据数据类型、交易性质和接收方身份。", "layer": "L2_business_rule", "template_type": "none", "source_kind": "workflow_rule", "module": "us_eo14117", "jurisdiction": "us", "doc_type": "workflow_rule", "authority_level": "low", "binding_force": "reference", "allowed_usage": ["internal_review", "risk_explanation"], "can_be_cited": false, "can_enter_external_report": false, "reference_ids": ["US-FED-001"], "citation_anchor": "EO 14117 §100.2 禁止交易类别", "scenario_tags": ["review", "issue_discovery", "prohibited_transaction"], "chunk_strategy": "workflow_step", "article_no": "", "path": "eo14117", "source_url": "", "snapshot_path": "", "keywords": [], "structured_payload": {"rule_name": "us_eo14117_prohibited_transaction", "output_action": "issue_discovery", "required_topics": ["data_brokerage", "government_related_data", "human_genomic_data", "covered_person"]}}
{"chunk_id": "WF-US-EO14117-RESTRICTED-CATEGORIES", "source_id": "WF-US-EO14117", "title": "EO 14117 §100.3 限制性交易类别与安全措施", "content": "EO 14117 §100.3 规定的限制性交易类别包括: 供应商协议、雇佣协议、投资协议中涉及涵盖人员且传输批量敏感个人数据的情形。限制性交易需实施以下安全措施: 逻辑隔离与访问控制、多因素认证、最小权限原则、数据脱敏与聚合、全面活动日志（保存至少1年）、员工培训与保密协议、定期独立审计（季度）、供应商合同中包含再传输限制条款。", "layer": "L2_business_rule", "template_type": "none", "source_kind": "workflow_rule", "module": "us_eo14117", "jurisdiction": "us", "doc_type": "workflow_rule", "authority_level": "low", "binding_force": "reference", "allowed_usage": ["internal_review", "risk_explanation"], "can_be_cited": false, "can_enter_external_report": false, "reference_ids": ["US-FED-001"], "citation_anchor": "EO 14117 §100.3 限制性交易类别与安全措施", "scenario_tags": ["review", "issue_discovery", "restricted_transaction", "security_measures"], "chunk_strategy": "workflow_step", "article_no": "", "path": "eo14117", "source_url": "", "snapshot_path": "", "keywords": [], "structured_payload": {"rule_name": "us_eo14117_restricted_categories", "output_action": "issue_discovery", "required_topics": ["vendor_agreement", "employment_agreement", "investment_agreement", "security_measures", "cybersecurity_requirements"]}}
{"chunk_id": "WF-US-EO14117-THRESHOLD", "source_id": "WF-US-EO14117", "title": "EO 14117 批量阈值判断标准", "content": "EO 14117 对各类敏感数据设定批量阈值: 人类基因组数据 >100人; 生物识别标识符 >1,000人; 精确地理位置数据 >1,000人; 个人健康数据 >10,000人; 个人金融数据 >10,000人; 涵盖个人标识符 >100,000人; 美国政府相关数据任何数量均触发。只有同时满足数据类型、批量阈值和涵盖人员三个条件时，才构成限制性或禁止性交易。", "layer": "L2_business_rule", "template_type": "none", "source_kind": "workflow_rule", "module": "us_eo14117", "jurisdiction": "us", "doc_type": "workflow_rule", "authority_level": "low", "binding_force": "reference", "allowed_usage": ["internal_review", "risk_explanation"], "can_be_cited": false, "can_enter_external_report": false, "reference_ids": ["US-FED-001"], "citation_anchor": "EO 14117 批量阈值判断标准", "scenario_tags": ["review", "issue_discovery", "data_classification"], "chunk_strategy": "workflow_step", "article_no": "", "path": "eo14117", "source_url": "", "snapshot_path": "", "keywords": [], "structured_payload": {"rule_name": "us_eo14117_bulk_thresholds", "output_action": "issue_discovery", "required_topics": ["human_genomic_data", "biometric_identifiers", "precise_geolocation_data", "personal_health_data", "personal_financial_data", "covered_personal_identifiers", "bulk_threshold"]}}
{"chunk_id": "WF-US-EO14117-COVERED-PERSON", "source_id": "WF-US-EO14117", "title": "EO 14117 涵盖人员识别标准", "content": "EO 14117 §100.1 定义涵盖人员 (covered person) 为由受关注国家拥有或控制的实体，或主要居住在受关注国家的个人。受关注国家包括中国、俄罗斯、朝鲜、伊朗、古巴、委内瑞拉。识别依据包括: 注册地、受管辖法律、所有权/控制权结构、政府投资、母公司国籍。对于有实际访问权限的外籍员工，需核查其国籍和常驻地。不明确的实体控制结构应采用保守立场，默认视为涵盖人员。", "layer": "L2_business_rule", "template_type": "none", "source_kind": "workflow_rule", "module": "us_eo14117", "jurisdiction": "us", "doc_type": "workflow_rule", "authority_level": "low", "binding_force": "reference", "allowed_usage": ["internal_review", "risk_explanation"], "can_be_cited": false, "can_enter_external_report": false, "reference_ids": ["US-FED-001"], "citation_anchor": "EO 14117 涵盖人员识别标准", "scenario_tags": ["review", "issue_discovery", "entity_screening"], "chunk_strategy": "workflow_step", "article_no": "", "path": "eo14117", "source_url": "", "snapshot_path": "", "keywords": [], "structured_payload": {"rule_name": "us_eo14117_covered_person", "output_action": "issue_discovery", "required_topics": ["country_of_concern", "ownership_control", "government_investment", "access_person_nationality"]}}
